></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">fcf21921-8d00-46e9-bcea-b99dba907436</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:fcf21921-8d00-46e9-bcea-b99dba907436\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:fcf21921-8d00-46e9-bcea-b99dba907436\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>In a secret room in the <a href=\"/wiki/Sorcerous_Vault\" title=\"Sorcerous Vault\">Sorcerous Vault</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;355&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;1009</span></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Lorroakan\" title=\"Lorroakan\">Lorroakan</a>,\n</p><p><br>\nWe see you, and we always will. Do take care to maintain utmost respect for the Art, and our purposes need not cross.\n</p><p><br>\nSigned by the Collective,\n</p><p>The Cowled Wizards of Amn\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202343\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.046 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.049 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1344/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 22265/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 5179/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 1/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.011/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 935646/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\